    {
      "id": "insight:473ab86045cd6865",
      "properties": {
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "grounded": true,
        "insight_type": "observation",
        "position_hint": 0.35,
        "text": "And I'll be the reckless one, apparently."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "insight:6745f6b01936982b",
      "properties": {
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "grounded": true,
        "insight_type": "recommendation",
        "position_hint": 0.5,
        "text": "Here's the proposition: for an ordinary investor, is diversification the answer \u2014 or a way to hide from decisions you should be making? Daniel, you first."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:daniel-cho",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Daniel Cho"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:6447c90b573ae431",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 332,
        "char_start": 285,
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Thanks, Nora. Happy to be the boring one today.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 12000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 6000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:scott-bessent",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Scott Bessent"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:960d327fdb3ad752",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 389,
        "char_start": 348,
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-03",
        "text": "And I'll be the reckless one, apparently.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 18000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 12000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "person:nora",
      "properties": {
        "name": "Nora"
      },
      "type": "Person"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:fcb06aa52e2436df",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 521,
        "char_start": 396,
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "Before we dig in \u2014 today's episode is sponsored by Vanguard. Vanguard pioneered low-cost index funds. Try vanguard.com today.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 24000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 18000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:31a26b87d9f8a1a8",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 675,
        "char_start": 521,
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-01",
        "text": "Here's the proposition: for an ordinary investor, is diversification the answer \u2014 or a way to hide from decisions you should be making? Daniel, you first.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 30000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 24000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:8c5908eb3c7c4faa",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 927,
        "char_start": 688,
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "For an individual investor, diversification is the closest thing to a free lunch that exists. You give up almost nothing, and you remove the single biggest way people ruin themselves \u2014 one position going to zero at the worst possible time.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 36000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 30000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:8e5165d8a6fb1da5",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 1139,
        "char_start": 927,
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "And I want to be precise: risk management for individuals is mostly behavioral. The math is easy. Sitting still while a holding gets cut in half is the hard part \u2014 and diversification is what makes it survivable.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 42000,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 36000,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "insight:authored-p05_e04-0",
      "properties": {
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "grounded": true,
        "insight_type": "claim",
        "position_hint": 0.5,
        "text": "For an individual investor, diversification is the closest thing to a free lunch that exists."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:authored-p05_e04-0",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 93,
        "char_start": 0,
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "speaker_id": "person:daniel-cho",
        "text": "For an individual investor, diversification is the closest thing to a free lunch that exists.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 0,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 0,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "insight:authored-p05_e04-1",
      "properties": {
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "grounded": true,
        "insight_type": "claim",
        "position_hint": 0.5,
        "text": "A portfolio is a system of correlated bets; a handful you understand deeply is more robust than a hundred you don't."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:authored-p05_e04-1",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 116,
        "char_start": 0,
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "speaker_id": "person:scott-bessent",
        "text": "A portfolio is a system of correlated bets; a handful you understand deeply is more robust than a hundred you don't.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 0,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 0,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "insight:authored-p05_e04-2",
      "properties": {
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "grounded": true,
        "insight_type": "claim",
        "position_hint": 0.5,
        "text": "Diversification is the only real risk control \u2014 concentration is how retail investors blow themselves up."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:authored-p05_e04-2",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 105,
        "char_start": 0,
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "speaker_id": "person:daniel-cho",
        "text": "Diversification is the only real risk control \u2014 concentration is how retail investors blow themselves up.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 0,
        "timestamp_start_ms": 0,
        "transcript_ref": "transcripts/p05_e04.txt"
      },
      "type": "Quote"
    },
    {
      "id": "insight:authored-p05_e04-3",
      "properties": {
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "grounded": true,
        "insight_type": "claim",
        "position_hint": 0.5,
        "text": "Concentration with deep understanding beats diversification \u2014 spreading thin is itself the risk, because you end up owning things you can't actually judge."
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
      "id": "quote:authored-p05_e04-3",
      "properties": {
        "char_end": 155,
        "char_start": 0,
        "episode_id": "ep-16ff698c1bd21087",
        "speaker_id": "person:scott-bessent",
        "text": "Concentration with deep understanding beats diversification \u2014 spreading thin is itself the risk, because you end up owning things you can't actually judge.",
        "timestamp_end_ms": 0,
